<section>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="center">
      <div class="eyebrow">The Weekly-ish Table</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">Weekly Teachings.</h2>
      <p class="lead narrow">Scripture taken seriously: the context, the original words, and what it asks of us. Each weekly teaching is a beginner study, about five pages, short enough to read in one sitting. Every one of them also has a fuller version in our <a href="/teachings/deeper/">Deeper Studies</a>, with more Scripture, more of the original languages, and more of what faithful teachers have said through the centuries. When a subject grabs you and you want the whole thing, that&rsquo;s where to go. A new one lands every week or so, and some weeks &ldquo;or so&rdquo; does a lot of heavy lifting. <a href="/#subscribe">Join the list</a> and each one comes to you the day it&rsquo;s ready. No calendar math required.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="teaching-list">
      {% for post in collections.teachings | weeklyOnly | reverse %}
      <article class="teaching-card">
        <div class="passage-badge">{{ post.data.passage }}</div>
        <h3><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h3>
        <div class="date">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</div>
        <p class="excerpt">{{ post.data.description }}</p>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

